      "headline": "Dynamics and Chaos: The Butterfly Paradox",
      "keyInsight": "For centuries, science promised that perfect knowledge yielded perfect foresight. If you knew the speed and direction of every billiard ball, you could forecast the entire game.\n\nChaos theory smashed this clockwork dream forever. Even when a system obeys strict, deterministic mathematical laws, long-term prediction can be physically impossible.\n\nTiny differences, smaller than the breath of a butterfly, compound exponentially over time. This exposes a stunning paradox: complete order and utter unpredictability coexist in the exact same system.\n\nDeterminism does not guarantee predictability.",
